# ThreadSanitizer suppressions for the test-tsan lane.
#
# The lane runs an uninstrumented CPython with an instrumented extension:
# TSan's interceptors see every pthread primitive and allocation, but
# only the shim/ring/aumem code carries instrumentation. Suppress only
# interpreter-internal noise here — never a report that names our C
# sources. Keep each entry commented with what it matches and why it is
# noise, so the file stays auditable.
